OL,3,GNEWSABlackpool arena plans not ruled
OL,4,Aout, council says
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlackpool Council insists it has not
OL,7,Fruled out the prospect of an arena for
OL,8,Fthe town, despite the proposals not
OL,9,Fbeing explicitly included in an update
OL,10,Fon its ambitious Blackpool Central
OL,11,Fproposals.
OL,13,FThe council was responding to
OL,14,Fquestioning about whether the proposals
OL,15,Ffor the 20,000-seat amenity fitted in
OL,16,Fwith its own Blackpool Central
OL,17,Fregenerations plans.
OL,19,FThe Blackpool Central project is a
OL,20,Fmajor #300m leisure-led regeneration
OL,21,Fscheme on the former Central Railway
OL,22,FStation site just off the Golden Mile.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
